{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は神宮外苑花火大会に参加させて頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めましての方乃木坂のパフォーマンスを見たのも何かの縁!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひよろしくお願いしますヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてすごく会場が広くてすごくびっくりしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなに人は一つの場所に集まるんだ〜と思ったりしたりして〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほいで!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂ふぁむの皆さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/11/4483082/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと見えたからね!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心強かったです!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/11/4483082/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんの笑顔を見るとネガティブも吹っ飛びました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかしまたこういう風にネガティブになるかもしれません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと自分で理解して、前向きに自分を正して行きますが、自分だけではダメなときもあります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その時は、皆さんに相談してもよろしいでしょうか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のブログのコメントを呼んで、気づいたこと、心が休まったこと、反省したこと沢山ありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんのコメントは心の支えです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくお願いしますヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてあしゅりんちゃん!!お誕生日おめでとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/11/4483082/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/11/4483082/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/11/4483082/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/11/4483082/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/11/4483082/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/11/4483082/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/11/4483082/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/11/4483082/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/11/4483082/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/11/4483082/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/11/4483082/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/11/4483082/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/11/4483082/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/11/4483082/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/11/4483082/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すんごくちっちゃくて、そしてかわいくて、でもしっかりしている。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅりんの頑張りを見ていると力が湧いてくるんだ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもまだ１４歳。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若いわぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつまでも乃木坂の癒しでいてね(生駒は毎日癒されてます)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではこのへんで!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスン行ってきます!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ!!"}],"source":"archive"}